# Set 1 · The Most Probable Paper

> The paper the record makes most likely: families that are due to return, the blind spots most likely to break, and the long, current stems of the 2023–2026 papers.

Set 1 brings back the **discipline half of Topic 1** (silent since 2023), asks about **gender-based violence** through the newest laws, turns **WID/WAD/GAD** to its next angle (mainstreaming) and the **waves** to the fourth wave, and breaks three blind spots — **education**, **women as voters** and the **UN conferences**. Its MCQs mirror the recent objective papers, with four keys of "None of these".

