# Set 3 · The Mixed Paper

> Probable and medium questions alongside difficult ones — the shape of most real papers.

Set 3 mixes **medium** questions (gender roles and stereotypes; patriarchy; women's paid work; the notes) with **difficult** ones (BISP through Moser and Kabeer; reserved seats and substantive representation; the three case studies compared). Its short-note question returns to the older "**any TWO**" form, with three notes to choose from — all three are answered.

